msgid "Updated in 0.3.2"
msgstr ""

msgid "Release notes now have their own page, separate from Legal."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Application and component license summaries are translated into Brazilian "
"Portuguese, English, Simplified Chinese and Spanish."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Legal notices now describe the portable dependencies and the Noto Sans CJK "
"font accurately, while preserving original licenses and authors."
msgstr ""

msgid "Recent improvements"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Version 0.3.1 introduced a saved interface-language selection and Ricardo "
"Barreto’s developer credit with a GitHub link."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Version 0.3.0 introduced the TuxFlash name and penguin icon, the x86-64 "
"portable runtime and clearer partition/filesystem indicators."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Windows volume labels follow the ISO filename. DD/RAW offers read-back "
"verification, and NTFS mounting can fall back from ntfs3 to ntfs-3g."
msgstr ""

msgid "Rufus, Lufus and TuxFlash"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Rufus is the original Windows application by Pete Batard and contributors. "
"Its original Windows code and resources remain in this project."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Lufus provides the native C/GTK Linux foundation and a separate privileged "
"helper for device operations."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"TuxFlash builds on that foundation with the current identity, Ricardo "
"Barreto’s contributions, four interface languages, packaging and integration "
"fixes. It runs natively on Linux without Wine."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Linux GTK interface follows the supplied Lufus layout; it is not the "
"original Win32 window. TuxFlash is an independent derivative, not an "
"official Rufus Linux release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Scope and known limits"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The ready-to-run portable package is Linux x86-64. Other architectures "
"require a separate build and validation; no claim is made for every Linux "
"distribution or every ISO."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"FFU is not supported. Windows To Go through a real desktop, Secure Boot and "
"real Linux persistence across reboots still lack complete validation. Full "
"feature parity with Rufus Windows has not been achieved."
msgstr ""

msgid "Free and open source"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"TuxFlash continues under GPL-3.0-or-later. You can use, study, modify and "
"redistribute it under that license. Third-party licenses and original "
"credits remain intact; see Legal for details."
msgstr ""

